   256	    - Extract the full TL motif component containing the TL anchor.
   257	    - Recolor the TL source motif in the output to the top-right anchor's color.
   258	    - For every other quadrant, reflect and scale the TL motif by the target/source
   259	      anchor-size ratio, align the scaled anchor region to the target anchor, and paint
   260	      every copied non-background pixel with that quadrant's own anchor color.

